<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I thank You that I have the rock, Your wise words,</l><l>That reveal the Father’s will to me.</l><l>Put in me a heart that would respond,</l><l>And a will to choose the narrow way.</l><l>Make me prudent, Lord, for the building of Your house,</l><l>And I would not fall, for I’d be founded on the rock.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
